XB-YuOS-Abi: __ABI__
Pre-Depends: yuos-framework (= __VERSION__)
Depends: yuos-abi-__ABI__
Recommends: nodejs, python3-pip, git, ripgrep, jq, sqlite3
Description: official Yu Agent for Yu OS
 Installs the optional first-party Yu Agent on top of `yuos-framework`: the
 unprivileged per-task `yuos-agentd` worker and the vendor Agent skills.
 `yuosd` claims Agent tasks, leases each worker its grant and persists its
 results; the Agent reaches Apps only through the tools those Apps expose.
 .
 Without this package the Framework, its system services and ordinary Apps
 keep working, while Agent tasks, triggers and Agent memory report that the
 Agent is not installed.
